e period, a stale, zero, negative, clamped or reverting oracle answer, a reference price\n      outside the representable range or rounding to zero, and a V3 pool with too little history all return\n      `(false, type(uint256).max)`. A reference contract that returns malformed data (not decodable as the\n      expected ABI types) still reverts, which fails closed for every consumer."},"functionSelector":"cf8b06c0","id":418,"implemented":true,"kind":"function","modifiers":[],"name":"isPriceTrusted","nameLocation":"12125:14:8","nodeType":"FunctionDefinition","parameters":{"id":283,"nodeType":"ParameterList","parameters":[{"constant":false,"id":282,"mutability":"mutable","name":"key","nameLocation":"12157:3:8","nodeType":"VariableDeclaration","scope":418,"src":"12140:20:8","stateVariable":false,"storageLocation":"calldata","typeDescriptions":{"typeIdentifier":"t_struct$_PoolKey_$5888_calldata_ptr","typeString":"struct PoolKey"},"typeName":{"id":281,"nodeType":"UserDefinedTypeName","pathNode":{"id":280,"name":"PoolKey","nameLocations":["12140:7:8"],"nodeType":"IdentifierPath","referencedDeclaration":5888,"src":"12140:7:8"},"referencedDeclaration":5888,"src":"12140:7:8","typeDescriptions":{"typeIdentifier":"t_struct$_PoolKey_$5888_storage_ptr","typeString":"struct PoolKey"}},"visibility":"internal"}],"src":"12139:22:8"},"returnParameters":{"id":288,"nodeType":"ParameterList","parameters":[{"constant":false,"id":285,"mutability":"mutable","name":"trusted","nameLocation":"12190:7:8","nodeType":"VariableDeclaration","scope":418,"src":"12185:12:8","stateVariable":false,"storageLocation":"default","typeDescriptions":{"typeIdentifier":"t_bool","typeString":"bool"},"typeName":{"id":284,"name":"bool","nodeType":"ElementaryTypeName","src":"12185:4:8","typeDescriptions":{"typeIdentifier":"t_bool","typeString":"bool"}},"visibility":"internal"},{"constant":false,"id":287,"mutability":"mutable","name":"devBps","nameLocation":"12207:6:8","nodeType":"VariableDeclaration","scope":418,"